WEBVTT

00:06.334 --> 00:09.344
<b>Keep your "correct response."</b>

00:10.504 --> 00:13.804
<b>You say you're not anything at all?</b>

00:13.804 --> 00:15.804
<b>If you're not anything at all yet,</b>

00:15.804 --> 00:19.354
<b>you should be free to become anything
you want from here forward.</b>

00:19.354 --> 00:21.354
<b>If you don't know how to fly,</b>

00:21.354 --> 00:25.274
<b>you can learn from someone
how to flap your wings.</b>

00:25.274 --> 00:30.524
<b>If you don't know how to live life,
you can walk in line with someone else!</b>

00:33.954 --> 00:37.034
<b>Have you arrived at your answer now?</b>

00:37.034 --> 00:41.164
<b>Yeah. My answer was settled
from very start.</b>

00:43.664 --> 00:49.674
<b>The arrangement is that Nagisa
Natsunagi can't die before I do.</b>

00:49.674 --> 00:53.134
<b>Sorry, but that's what was promised.</b>

01:02.224 --> 01:03.774
<b>Nagisa-<i>san</i>!</b>

01:29.134 --> 01:31.004
<b>Sorry it took so long!</b>

01:33.254 --> 01:37.634
<b>Right, Saikawa. That twinkle of blue
that shines even in the dark</b>

01:37.634 --> 01:40.804
<b>is surely worth three billion yen.</b>

01:44.024 --> 01:50.194
<b>Well played... I'm finished
going easy on you.</b>

01:50.194 --> 01:56.534
<b>Without fail, here and now,
I shall give you your death!</b>

02:03.374 --> 02:07.234
From the very moment you caught my eye

02:03.374 --> 02:07.234
<b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>wo </b><b>mi</b><b>te</b><b>ta </b><b>a</b><b>no </b><b>hi </b><b>ka</b><b>ra</b>

02:07.414 --> 02:15.354
It felt like everything would change

02:07.414 --> 02:15.354
<b>su</b><b>be</b><b>te </b><b>ga </b><b></b><b>ka</b><b>wa</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>na </b><b>ki </b><b>ga </b><b>shi</b><b>te</b><b>ta</b>

