My heart is still searching

02:53.144 --> 02:55.384
<b>a</b><b>no </b><b>se</b><b>ka</b><b>i </b><b>de </b><b>mi</b><b>tsu</b><b>ke</b><b>ta</b>

02:55.524 --> 02:57.784
For that important thing

02:55.524 --> 02:57.784
<b>ta</b><b>i</b><b>se</b><b>tsu </b><b>na </b><b>na</b><b>ni</b><b>ka </b><b>wo</b>

02:58.044 --> 03:02.454
It discovered in that world.

02:58.044 --> 03:02.454
<b>ko</b><b>no </b><b>ko</b><b>ko</b><b>ro </b><b>wa </b><b>sa</b><b>ga</b><b>shi</b><b>mo</b><b>to</b><b>me</b><b>te</b><b>ru</b>

03:02.734 --> 03:05.434
Hey, I want us to always smile together

03:02.734 --> 03:05.434
<b>ne</b><b>e, </b><b>zu</b><b>t</b><b>to </b><b>ko</b><b>ko </b><b>de </b><b>ki</b><b>mi </b><b>to</b>

03:05.654 --> 03:08.084
So right here and now

03:05.654 --> 03:08.084
<b>wa</b><b>ra</b><b>t</b><b>te </b><b>i</b><b>ra</b><b>re</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b><b>u </b><b>ni</b>

03:08.364 --> 03:11.874
I'll make you a promise

03:08.364 --> 03:11.874
<b>ya</b><b>ku</b><b>so</b><b>ku </b><b>wo </b><b>su</b><b>ru </b><b>yo</b>

03:13.514 --> 03:16.054
That will transcend time

03:13.514 --> 03:16.054
<b>to</b><b>ki </b><b>wo </b><b>ko</b><b>e</b><b>te, </b><b>i</b><b>ma</b>

03:32.964 --> 03:36.964
Episode 11

03:32.964 --> 03:36.964
Episode 11

03:32.964 --> 03:36.964
A Light in the Midst of Hope

03:32.964 --> 03:36.964
A Light in the Midst of Hope

03:33.964 --> 03:37.844
<b>It was at some moment,
when I had said to Siesta,</b>

03:37.844 --> 03:43.934
<b>"You seem like you should be called
a secret agent more than a detective."</b>

03:43.934 --> 03:48.604
<b>Kimi, although you say
I'm not really a detective,</b>

03:48.604 --> 03:51.234
<b>I consider the definition
of "detective" as being</b>

03:51.234 --> 03:55.614
<b>"one who protects the interests
of a client at all times."</b>

03:55.614 --> 03:59.114
<b>I take pride in that sort of work.</b>

03:59.114 --> 04:02.194
<b>That's why I have in the past,
and will always in the future,</b>

04:02.194 --> 04:04.864
<b>continue to be a detective.</b>

04:07.164 --> 04:13.084
<b>So saying, Siesta stood firm in
her own identity as a detective.</b>

04:13.084 --> 04:19.554
<b>What Siesta meant by "client" was surely
every human being other than herself.</b>

04:19.554 --> 04:26.094
<b>For that reason, she referred to herself
as "a legendary detective by nature"...</b>

04:26.094 --> 04:30.184
<b>...and laughed. Her smile
was beyond radiant.</b>

04:34.524 --> 04:38.404
<b>To be honest, from here on,
I'm just winging it.</b>

04:38.404 --> 04:41.734
<b>It was close, but we managed
to save Natsunagi.</b>

04:41.734 --> 04:44.824
<b>The fact that Saikawa raced over here</b>

04:44.824 --> 04:48.324
<b>tells me that the evacuation of all the
other passengers should be complete.</b>

04:48.324 --> 04:50.624
<b>In which case, everything's good.</b>

04:50.624 --> 04:55.164
<b>If the only one who goes down with
the ship is me, that's just fine.</b>

04:55.164 --> 05:00.754
<b>Ooh, there's a resolute look in your eye.
Intending to die alone, are you?</b>

05:00.754 --> 05:04.094
<b>No. Sorry, but you're going to join me.</b>

05:04.094 --> 05:10.054
<b>I regret to say I do not intend to
hand my life over to you, though.</b>

05:10.054 --> 05:12.974
<b>And after I've finished killing you,</b>

05:12.974 --> 05:17.854
<b>I will make a point of taking
the lives of those girls as well.</b>

05:17.854 --> 05:22.484
<b>But rest assured, I won't
kill them too easily.</b>

05:22.484 --> 05:24.654
<b>"Won't kill them too easily"?</b>

05:24.654 --> 05:31.084
<b>Correct. Because, at any rate,
they possess that eye and that heart,</b>

05:31.084 --> 05:34.164
<b>so from the tips of their toes to
every single hair on their heads,</b>

05:34.164 --> 05:37.924
<b>it's worth examining them
meticulously, no?</b>

05:37.924 --> 05:40.964
<b>Why, I'll torment them
until, by the time I'm done,</b>

05:40.964 --> 05:44.134
<b>they'll cry and plead,
"Please, let me die!"</b>

05:44.134 --> 05:48.514
<b>And at the very, very end I'll grant
them death through this torture.</b>

05:50.264 --> 05:53.514
<b>Well, now, that's more than enough talk.</b>

05:53.514 --> 05:56.984
<b>Have you made a reservation
for your trip to Hell?</b>

05:56.984 --> 06:02.024
<b>No. Unfortunately, that destination
isn't on my itinerary.</b>

06:02.024 --> 06:05.944
<b>Isn't it? Well, now...</b>

06:07.154 --> 06:08.784
<b>Die.</b>

06:13.334 --> 06:15.454
<b>You overestimate yourself.</b>

06:20.584 --> 06:25.004
<b>How could the likes of you,
an ordinary human, defeat us?</b>

06:26.844 --> 06:29.474
<b>You can't protect anyone.</b>

06:29.474 --> 06:31.844
<b>You talk too much!</b>

06:31.844 --> 06:33.804
<b>You will die here,</b>

06:33.804 --> 06:39.484
<b>and the girls you helped to escape, I will
kill, without fail, with this very hand.</b>

06:39.484 --> 06:42.814
<b>Damn you... Shut up!</b>

06:42.814 --> 06:46.114
<b>Everything you've done was in vain.</b>

06:46.114 --> 06:50.954
<b>You, and the human beings you're
trying to protect, will all die.</b>

06:50.954 --> 06:55.244
<b>Just like that loathsome
legendary detective.</b>

06:56.294 --> 07:03.964
<b>I'm going to die. That's fine.
But Natsunagi and Saikawa...</b>

07:03.964 --> 07:09.554
<b>...I have to protect the two of them.
I must defend my clients' lives.</b>

07:14.184 --> 07:19.814
<b>As Char said, I'm no more
than a sidekick. And yet...</b>

07:20.774 --> 07:25.774
<b>...I intend to carry on the legacy of the
legendary detective's dying wish, too!</b>

07:39.334 --> 07:40.584
<b>Char!</b>

07:40.584 --> 07:42.674
<b>Kimizuka! Hit the deck!</b>

07:44.044 --> 07:46.924
<b>Have a taste of this!</b>

07:55.514 --> 07:57.604
<b>Fuubi-<i>san</i>!</b>

07:57.604 --> 08:00.984
<b>Looks like you've had quite
a tough fight, Kimizuka!</b>

08:00.984 --> 08:04.854
<b>That Char... So she was intending
to do this from the start.</b>

08:04.854 --> 08:06.814
<b>See, from the time I boarded this ship,</b>

08:06.814 --> 08:09.984
<b>I felt a horrid presence
that was familiar to me.</b>

08:09.984 --> 08:12.454
<b>I made all possible preparations.</b>

08:12.454 --> 08:15.914
<b>Still, I'm grateful you came, Char.</b>

08:15.914 --> 08:22.664
<b>So that means step aside, Kimizuka.
From here on, it's my turn!</b>

08:27.254 --> 08:28.794
<b>Curses! The impudence...</b>

08:28.794 --> 08:31.634
<b>Go ahead, dodge around all you can!</b>

08:31.634 --> 08:34.434
<b>I can't tell which one is the bad guy.</b>

08:34.434 --> 08:36.684
<b>Kimizuka!</b>

08:36.684 --> 08:44.774
<b>I don't like you; I hate you! But...
But you were the one chosen by Mom.</b>

08:44.774 --> 08:49.194
<b>Not me, but you, who I hate.
If that's how it is...</b>

08:49.194 --> 08:52.114
<b>If that's how it is, all I can do
is turn things over to you!</b>

08:52.114 --> 08:57.284
<b>If Mom, who I loved,
chose you, who I hate...</b>

08:57.284 --> 09:01.794
<b>...there's no choice but to rely on you!</b>

09:01.794 --> 09:03.294
<b>Char...</b>

09:03.294 --> 09:08.634
<b>Kimizuka! This time around, the two of us
are going to make this mission succeed!</b>

09:08.634 --> 09:12.844
<b>Yeah, I'm on board with that.
It's been my intention from the start!</b>

09:17.344 --> 09:20.054
<b>Enough!</b>

09:21.974 --> 09:23.984
<b>Char! Watch out!</b>

09:33.904 --> 09:35.744
<b>We've been hit.</b>

09:37.914 --> 09:39.534
<b>Oh, no.</b>

09:44.294 --> 09:47.504
<b>In this state, no attack can strike me!</b>

09:47.504 --> 09:52.804
<b>I'll be coming to kill you shortly. You can
gnaw on your fingertips while you wait.</b>

09:52.804 --> 09:54.384
<b>Where are you?!</b>

09:58.304 --> 09:59.554
<b>Char!</b>

10:17.864 --> 10:19.744
<b>Kimizuka?</b>

10:22.284 --> 10:24.744
<b>Oh. I get it.</b>

10:24.744 --> 10:29.924
<b>I was also thinking it was about time
a certain someone quit smoking.</b>

10:29.924 --> 10:33.214
<b>Hmph. No way around it, I guess.</b>

10:50.234 --> 10:53.114
<b>It's hot!</b>

10:53.114 --> 10:56.324
<b>I'll die...</b>

10:57.994 --> 10:59.654
<b>Chew on this!</b>

11:09.214 --> 11:13.464
<b>Curses! Curse you!</b>

11:24.604 --> 11:27.684
<b>I'll absolutely put an end to you here!</b>

11:27.684 --> 11:30.814
<b>I won't let you kill
Natsunagi and Saikawa!</b>

11:37.864 --> 11:40.614
<b>The fuselage won't hold up.
We're headed back!</b>

11:40.614 --> 11:42.204
<b>Not yet!</b>

11:46.414 --> 11:48.954
<b>We're changing locations.</b>

11:59.804 --> 12:01.924
<b>Kimizuka!</b>

12:33.544 --> 12:37.174
<b>Sies... ta...</b>

12:52.734 --> 12:54.944
<b>Siesta...</b>

12:58.694 --> 13:00.734
<b>Hel...</b>

13:00.734 --> 13:05.364
<b>I never imagined you'd break through the
mind control to come in and land a punch.</b>

13:07.664 --> 13:12.124
<b>You said she was the most important
thing in the world to you.</b>

13:12.124 --> 13:13.454
<b>That's just--</b>

13:13.454 --> 13:16.254
<b>I really appreciate you
professing your love,</b>

13:16.254 --> 13:20.924
<b>but weren't you trying to damage
the face of that person you love?</b>

13:37.234 --> 13:40.114
<b>I made you cry...</b>

13:40.114 --> 13:44.654
<b>Siesta... Is it you?</b>

13:47.204 --> 13:53.744
<b>No! I won't allow...
such a... ludicrous thing.</b>

13:53.744 --> 13:59.294
<b>This... willfully...
taking over my body...</b>

13:59.294 --> 14:04.344
<b>Be quiet. I'm speaking with him now.</b>

14:07.434 --> 14:11.434
<b>Siesta... You...</b>

14:11.434 --> 14:17.444
<b>Sidekick... There's no time,
so listen carefully.</b>

14:17.444 --> 14:21.274
<b>The truth is, my heart is of
a slightly exceptional make.</b>

14:21.274 --> 14:23.444
<b>I pondered over various schemes,</b>

14:23.444 --> 14:27.364
<b>but couldn't come up with
another way besides this.</b>

14:27.364 --> 14:29.414
<b>If it were only about
defeating her, I could have.</b>

14:29.414 --> 14:31.744
<b>If it were only about killing her,
it would have been simple.</b>

14:31.744 --> 14:39.334
<b>But she--Alicia--said that she wanted
to live, wanted to attend school.</b>

14:41.424 --> 14:47.214
<b>Therefore, I've infiltrated this body
and suppressed Hel's consciousness.</b>

14:47.214 --> 14:51.724
<b>That was the one and only method
that could save Alicia.</b>

14:51.724 --> 14:55.894
<b>But that's... That doesn't mean...</b>

14:55.894 --> 15:01.104
<b>Because protecting a client's
interests is a detective's job.</b>

15:01.104 --> 15:03.654
<b>Siesta, so from the beginning you--</b>

15:03.654 --> 15:04.734
<b>I've told you:</b>

15:04.734 --> 15:10.864
<b>A real detective gets a handle on
a case before the incident occurs.</b>

15:10.864 --> 15:14.414
<b>I knew some time ago
that it would come to this.</b>

15:14.414 --> 15:18.504
<b>How...? How could you?</b>

15:18.504 --> 15:23.174
<b>You can't just decide something
like this all on your own.</b>

15:24.754 --> 15:28.804
<b>If I had said anything,
you would've stopped me, Kimi.</b>

15:33.144 --> 15:36.264
<b>I have a favor to ask you.</b>

15:36.264 --> 15:38.024
<b>The answer's no.</b>

15:38.894 --> 15:39.854
<b>Hear me out.</b>

15:39.854 --> 15:41.694
<b>I refuse.</b>

15:41.694 --> 15:44.064
<b>How stupid are you, Kimi?</b>

15:49.534 --> 15:52.574
<b>This is no time to be obstinate.</b>

15:52.574 --> 15:55.784
<b>If I suppress Hel's fiendish intentions,</b>

15:55.784 --> 16:01.374
<b>Alicia's personality is sure
to awaken again in this body.</b>

16:02.294 --> 16:03.874
<b>Alicia?</b>

16:03.874 --> 16:08.254
<b>She may once again have lost her memory.</b>

16:08.254 --> 16:10.634
<b>Even if she has, I want you
to seek her cooperation,</b>

16:10.634 --> 16:13.594
<b>and, in time, bring down SPES.</b>

16:13.594 --> 16:18.104
<b>But that means your consciousness
will be snuffed out along with Hel!</b>

16:18.104 --> 16:22.774
<b>I won't allow such a thing! That's not
the kind of resolution I'd wish for!</b>

16:22.774 --> 16:26.904
<b>I don't care in what form--
even as an enemy is fine--</b>

16:26.904 --> 16:32.824
<b>as long as you... as long as your
consciousness stays alive somewhere...</b>

16:32.824 --> 16:40.294
<b>I thought you'd say that. But it's fine.
Alicia has something I don't have.</b>

16:40.294 --> 16:44.124
<b>With her, things will go great
for you, I'm sure of it.</b>

16:44.124 --> 16:48.384
<b>Stop willfully driving the conversation
forward! I still haven't--</b>

16:52.094 --> 16:55.014
<b>I wonder if this is also some
form of synchronicity.</b>

16:58.764 --> 17:04.484
<b>Pollen... So that's it... That culture
festival, the Hanako-<i>san </i>incident...</b>

17:01.724 --> 17:03.184
<b>Hanako-san is coming for you!</b>

17:04.484 --> 17:08.114
<b>That drug that so horribly
afflicted my middle school...</b>

17:08.114 --> 17:14.114
<b>So that was derived from a flower
that blooms on this thing's body...</b>

17:14.114 --> 17:19.584
<b>But as a side effect, cases of
memory impairment also occur.</b>

17:19.584 --> 17:24.874
<b>No... I don't want to... forget.</b>

17:26.044 --> 17:33.134
<b>It'll be all right. Well, it's possible
you may forget a few things.</b>

17:33.134 --> 17:39.934
<b>But even so, you won't forget me, Kimi.
You'll never cast aside our mission.</b>

17:39.934 --> 17:42.604
<b>You'll keep doing the work for me,</b>

17:42.604 --> 17:45.524
<b>together with Alicia, sighing,
"This is absurd" all the while.</b>

17:45.524 --> 17:49.864
<b>That's unacceptable... I refuse.</b>

17:51.574 --> 17:59.954
<b>I'm your sidekick. I won't go and
become a partner... of anyone else.</b>

17:59.954 --> 18:03.624
<b>At the very end, you say such
gratifying things for me.</b>

18:03.624 --> 18:10.294
<b>I don't want to forget...
about you... ever...</b>

18:10.294 --> 18:12.214
<b>It'll be all right.</b>

18:13.804 --> 18:15.674
<b>It's like we said:</b>

18:15.674 --> 18:20.684
<b>We got through it all by trusting each
other more than we trusted ourselves.</b>

18:22.264 --> 18:26.814
<b>So you're insisting...
I trust what you're saying?</b>

18:26.814 --> 18:32.944
<b>That's it. Until now, has there ever
been a time I was wrong?</b>

18:32.944 --> 18:36.324
<b>No, there hasn't. Not a single time.</b>

18:36.324 --> 18:41.784
<b>You've always been right.
You were <i>too </i>right.</b>

18:43.204 --> 18:46.004
<b>That's why, for once...</b>

18:49.874 --> 18:52.464
<b>...I wanted you to be wrong.</b>

18:54.214 --> 19:00.264
<b>Next time you wake up, I'm sure
I'll already be gone, but...</b>

19:05.604 --> 19:10.194
<b>Do you hear me? I won't forget you!</b>

19:10.194 --> 19:13.154
<b>Even if my consciousness is stripped
away by a fiendish enemy,</b>

19:13.154 --> 19:15.864
<b>you're the one thing I won't forget, Kimi!</b>

19:18.074 --> 19:29.004
<b>It may take time... A week, a month,
a year! It may take a long time.</b>

19:29.004 --> 19:36.254
<b>But nevertheless, this body will come to
meet you, without fail, one more time!</b>

19:37.714 --> 19:39.724
<b>Absolutely.</b>

19:41.884 --> 19:43.804
<b>Absolutely!</b>

19:56.234 --> 19:58.864
<b>That's right...</b>

19:58.864 --> 20:05.124
<b>That's what Siesta said: "Together with
Alicia, take down SPES for me."</b>

20:05.124 --> 20:10.794
<b>That was her final wish. And...</b>

20:13.834 --> 20:18.254
<b>A ribbon sounds nice...
I'd also love to wear one...</b>

20:18.254 --> 20:22.014
<b>...and try attending a real school.</b>

20:23.514 --> 20:25.264
<b>Natsunagi is...</b>

20:34.234 --> 20:40.574
<b>Kill... I'll kill you... I'll kill you!</b>

20:49.204 --> 20:55.174
<b>However cruel reality may be...
I won't run from it anymore.</b>

20:55.174 --> 20:59.754
<b>Until I've fulfilled my
promise to Siesta, I'll...</b>

21:06.974 --> 21:09.264
<b>How stupid are you, Kimi?</b>

21:15.814 --> 21:18.524
<b>Hand-to-hand combat against a monster?</b>

21:19.864 --> 21:24.904
<b>You can't even call that "rash"--
more like "madness."</b>

21:32.664 --> 21:38.674
<b>You'll now be unable
to attack me ever again.</b>

21:48.394 --> 21:50.474
<b>It's been a long time.</b>

21:56.814 --> 22:03.824
<b>Yeah. Have you had enough
of napping... Siesta?</b>

